        "definition_short": "Proportion of women in ministerial level positions (%)",
        "methodology": "It is calculated by dividing the number of women Cabinet members by the total number of ministers, which includes both women and men who head Ministries. The data is compiled from Permanent Missions to the United Nations, official government websites, and other publicly available sources.",
        "title": "Proportion of women in ministerial level positions (%)",
        "topics": [
            {
                "id": "P2",
                "name": "People",
                "vocabulary": "WB Practice Groups"
            },
            {
